step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy with the strong NaiveSeasonal model to see if a single model outperforms the trimmed mean ensemble.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"NaiveSeasonal"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the strong DWT_catboost model to see if it can beat the trimmed_mean pool2 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the smaller, highly ranked pool1 to see if a simple robust aggregator outperforms trimmed mean pool2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a deterministic Bayesian averaging (dba) on the stable pool1 to see if it improves over the current median best.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test median aggregation on the larger pool3 to see if adding more models improves over median pool1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Try a median over pool2 to see if adding rf improves over pool1 median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a trimmed mean over the full model pool to see if including all models with trimming improves over current best median pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a deterministic Bayesian averaging over pool2 to see if adding rf improves over pool1 median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a deterministic Bayesian averaging over the larger pool3 to see if adding the extra models improves on the current median best.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted average using inverse error weighting on the stable pool1 to see if it beats the current median best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","DWT_catboost","ONLY_DWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool4 to see if it beats the current weighted winner.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a simple mean of the robust pool4 to see if averaging beats the median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

